    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2347163059",
      "Source": "A reclusive mad scientist, driven by obsession and revenge, toils deep within his decaying lair, crafting twisted, powerful creations—born of corrupted matter and unstable flesh. Each SUBJECT is engineered with a singular purpose: to annihilate the enemy who once betrayed and ruined them. As the final subject awakens, the scientist’s long-awaited plan for vengeance is set into motion.<#RN#><#RN#>WARNING! This might be very difficult so you better be prepared before this.<#RN#><#RN#>Good Luck,Survivor.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一位隐世的疯狂科学家，被执念与复仇之心驱使，在其腐朽的巢穴深处辛勤劳作，创造出扭曲而强大的造物 —— 它们由腐化的物质与不稳定的血肉诞生。每一个「实验体」都被赋予单一的目标：歼灭曾背叛并摧毁它们的敌人。当最后一个实验体苏醒时，科学家等待已久的复仇计划便开始启动。<#RN#><#RN#>警告！ 这可能极具挑战性，你最好在此之前做好准备。<#RN#><#RN#>祝你好运，生存者。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::522314526",
      "Source": "Corrupted Meraxes Flag #1",
      "Trans": {"SC":"腐化米拉西斯龙旗帜#1","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::553698388",
      "Source": "This flag is proof that you have defeated the rageful SUBJECT.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这面旗帜证明你已击败暴怒的实验体米拉西斯龙。","JA":""},
